                <pb facs="0192" n="88" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg88"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    243.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Barillas to
                        Mr. Hosmer.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-26"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 26,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Gen. Manuel L. Barillas courteously salutes the Hon. Mr. James R. Hosmer and
                    requests him to please come to his house for conversation upon an important
                    matter.</p>
            </div>
